commit 181b1d0ec8a656e35c46f20a17e84b1fd20e4616
Author: cracki <cracki@gmail.com>
Date:   Wed Oct 7 15:02:03 2026 +0330

    fix(qa4-img2): dedicated AI services field + strict junk filter + scraper hardening
    
    QA4-img2/img8/new6 root causes, all verified and fixed at three layers:
    1. AI output: brand_core_analyzer prompt now requires a dedicated
       'services' array (2-10 concrete services, NOT marketing statements)
       parsed separately from usp_list (build_core_analysis_payload);
       BrandCoreAnalysis.services persisted (migration 0015).
    2. Filter: brand/text_utils.py blanket service-keyword bypass limited
       to <=6-word strings that don't match the new shared blocklist
       (core/utils/text_patterns.py: auth widgets, CTA labels, blog titles,
       marketing sentences); services context drops >8-word strings and
       single words without a service keyword ('Villas').
    3. Scraper: _strip_junk_regions decomposes nav/form/header/aside/button
       + role attributes; card strategy skips cards with forms/auth links
       and junk headings.
    Choke point: get_merged_service_names filters the final merged list;
    get_core_service_names returns analysis services (never usp_list);
    builder no longer merges usp_list into services.
    Empirically verified: all 7 QA-report junk strings dropped
    ('with an average rating of 4', 'Book home services in less than 60
    seconds', 'Sign in or register', 'Reset password', 'renovation company
    in Dubai', 'Villas', '7 Warning Signs Your Dubai Property'); real
    services kept. brand/tests_qa4_services.py: 15 tests.

